# experiments/

Per-run experimental artifacts. Layout:

  experiments/$date_$algo_$variant/
    metadata.json    -- seeds, hyperparameters, upstream library git hashes
    run.py           -- the actual run script (or symlink to one)
    results/         -- seed-by-seed outputs
    plots/           -- matplotlib outputs

Individual run subdirectories are gitignored (they may be large); only
this `.gitkeep` is tracked.
